  "remarks": "Cruise Missile Industry Group was listed pursuant to paragraph 12 of resolution 1737 (2006), as read with resolutions 1747, 1803 and 1929, as: an entity involved in nuclear or ballistic missile activities. Production and development of cruise missiles. Responsible for naval missiles including cruise missiles. The Director Disqualification Sanction was imposed on 09/04/2025.",
